{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Splash &amp; Dash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're drifting around corners at breakneck speed, paint splashing everywhere. Your buddy's screaming because you just launched them out of the arena. Your other friend pulls off some ridiculous aerial stunt. This is Splash &amp; Dash. Friendship goes to die here. Legends are born here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[Imagine an awesome GIF here: cars ramming, drifting, paint trails, and someone getting launched into orbit by an opponent]</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paint to Win</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race. Drift. Splatter. The player who covers the most territory in their colour wins. Every drift refills your paint tank. Power-ups scattered across the map give you the edge you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[Another cool GIF here:  paint tank refilling when drifting]</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick Your Class</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavies:</strong> Built like tanks. Ram opponents into the stratosphere.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedsters:</strong> Slide through corners like butter, leave chaos in your wake.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standards:</strong> Reliable, balanced, deadly. Vanilla never tasted so good.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[I really should take time to do these GIFs: showing off all the vehicle classes in action.]</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Game, Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise match length and rules. Want quick 2-minute rounds? Done. Epic 10-minute battles? Also done. Local couch co-op or online multiplayer. Your call.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every trophy unlocks new characters, wild vehicles, eye-searing colours, and game-changing abilities. Every match matters. Every unlock shifts the meta.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Impossible to Put Down</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can pick this up in minutes. Mastering it takes time. Trash-talk on the couch or dominate online lobbies. Splash &amp; Dash delivers pure, chaotic fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[Maybe GIF Split-screen  4-player local multiplayer chaos ]</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why We Made This</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a team of 4 who miss when games brought people together.\u00a0 When art popped off the screen and made you smile. <strong>Splash &amp; Dash</strong>\u00a0tries to bring back pure gaming joy. The kind that makes you forget what time it is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[GIF  Victory screen celebration</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884060?t=1759428230","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3884060?t=1759428230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884060/719e7d577e022537599d95f90736c1b1abed78fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759428230","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884060/719e7d577e022537599d95f90736c1b1abed78fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759428230","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjust